          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "wesnoth-icon.png",
            text: _("Karrag is not recruiting yet, so the longer it takes you to reach and confront him, the more gold he’ll have had time to stockpile. Open the Status Table (<i>Alt+S</i>) to check your opponents’ gold and income. _Of course, the longer you wait to confront Karrag, the more gold you’ll have time to stockpile too."),
          },
